{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_5_level_main_05-10_end",
  "groupId": "main_5",
  "stageId": "main_05-10",
  "title": "The Dark Before Dawn",
  "storyCode": "5-10",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-10_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "58f9eb1f4a251cf3f2e6e05891b61b676388a2a7b76430215e35a6d2557237e7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "You have nowhere left to run.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "...Damn... you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Where do you think you're going?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Ngh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Put your hands where I can see them!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "I've seen through all your tricks, kid with the scales!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "I told you, that's not going to work!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Blaze!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Hmph, don't worry. These attacks hurt about as much as firecrackers!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "You blocked my shots in advance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "You know where they're coming from?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Of course I do, I've already figured you out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Amiya, back off. I'm going to use 'that'!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Got it! I'll disrupt Mephisto's guards again, so make it quick!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Take this bit of my blood as a farewell gift, Reunion's 'Phantom Crossbowmen!'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Seethe, and blast apart their disguise!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "You're using your own blood as an incendiary?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Hah, do I look like some sort of caster to you? Only some egotistical newbie would go around committing arson like that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Sorry, but this is just one of my fighting techniques. Show yourselves - you have nowhere to hide!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "text": "Faust, my camouflage is gone.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Command, retreat.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "What are those...?! When did Reunion hide snipers over there?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "text": "Now?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Right now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "Multiple Reunion snipers have appeared, primarily in the 2nd floor of the east building and the 3rd floor of the south building!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Proceed with caution. They might have set up ambushes for us on the lower levels!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "Was the strange phenomenon in the building also caused by them?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Clever, you used refraction to make themselves seem invisible.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "However, you can't completely conceal your tracks, or make sudden movements without compromising the effect of your Arts.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Am I correct?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "...You're quite smart.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "It's all because of our great intel. Now that you know the gig's up, you should surrender.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "If you want to continue fighting, I'll make you pay for the deaths of Ace and Scout. Hmph, I don't even care if you weren't involved, kid.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "text": "Faust, we still have ammunition.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Retreat. We've already lost our intel advantage. I will keep them occupied. The rest of you, move immediately.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "text": "Understood.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Why aren't you shooting her? Faust!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Attack, my guards! Hurry! There are four of them, just four... and only three of them pose any threat!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Fight! Tear apart those sinners now!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "With Dr. {@nickname}'s leadership, the three of us are more than enough to defeat all of you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Not to mention, those Infected who you harmed, who you robbed of their free will to the point of not even being people anymore...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Even that scaled boy next to you might not side with you anymore. His thoughts are filled with sorrow and turmoil...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Mephisto, you are alone on this battlefield!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "You can read my mind?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "No, I just felt it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "So, you'd have no idea what I'm thinking.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Amiya!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I'm fine, I can barely block his shots...! However, I won't be able to keep suppressing...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto's Guard",
      "text": "GRAAAAAAGHHH!! AAAARRRRGGHH!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "My control is slipping!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Mephisto, let's go.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Their reinforcements are wiping out our forces.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "We've never even seen some of them before. There's been a change in the plan. Our moves have been read.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "...Why haven't our forces come? We have over twenty squads and two major brigades, so why are none of them here still?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Where is Crownslayer? Or FrostNova?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "This isn't like Chernobog. We couldn't shut down the enemy's communications, so they were able to call lots of reinforcements and put up a vigorous resistance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Mephisto...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Where are they still not here yet?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "We won't know the reason unless we see it for ourselves. Let's get out of here first.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Blaze, I'm about to reach my limit. Can you finish this?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Sure thing. Just me and that Ch'en lady should suffice!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Quick!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Did I give you permission to leave?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "You... Guards! Kill her! Kill her!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto's Guard",
      "text": "Grrr... Grooooar!!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Tsk... Over a dozen of them started moving at once. That's going to be a pain.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto's Guard",
      "text": "GROOAAAAAR!!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "They're coming at us, Ch'en!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Thank you, Rhodes Island operator. Now, nobody can get in my way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "(Haah... it's still no good? I don't have a way to completely counteract their cloaking... Forget it, this should be good enough.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "(Chi Xiao, this time...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "'Crimson overflowing—'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto's Guard",
      "text": "...Gah!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "...Can it be...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto's Guard",
      "text": "Uaaagh... Argh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto's Guard",
      "text": "Thank... you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Did you unsheath your sword just then? Just one slash? And you managed to cut down a dozen of those things?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "That sword...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Amiya, I think I should start choosing my words a lot more carefully around her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Hmph.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "You... What did you do...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Run!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "You can't escape either.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Gah...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Faust... Faust! You're injured! You're... no, no... Nooo!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "It's over.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Not yet.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "What?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "*cough* *cough*... He lured me in to shoot from point blank?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Didn't you manage to block it though?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "They used the cover of the explosion to make their escape!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Woah, a chain of explosions?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Argh, the entire top level is collapsing! We're not going to be able to chase after them?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Half of that was your doing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Can't do a thing about that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Hurry, we need to go.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "No, I need to stay here, until they come...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "We've failed this step. You must leave.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "I failed? I failed? Impossible!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Wasn't everything going according to plan...? Did I not call for our reinforcements a long time ago?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Were we betrayed? Was our information leaked? Who was it? Why does the L.G.D. know about our deployment and our strategies?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Just go!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "If we weren't betrayed, then who could have done it?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Talulah would never make a mistake... So she must have planned for this...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "No, that's impossible... Why would she set us up like this?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "...Faust, there's no way I can accept this... I refuse to believe it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Jump! I'll hold on to you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Fine...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Well... shoot, Madam. Looks like this building's going to need some serious renovating.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "It's a shame that those two kids got away though.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Those mindless followers are still coming at us like cornered animals. Dealing with all of them is still going to be a serious thorn in the side.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "At least we managed to take back the headquarters.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "This is our victory, even if it's a short-lived one.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Amiya...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "How did Rhodes Island manage to make it out of Chernobog?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Miss Blaze came to our aid in the knick of time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "There was also a loud-mouthed L.G.D. officer just outside the ruined city...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "It would've been easier if you had just helped us in the first place instead of watching from the sidelines.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "I was expecting you to say something like 'I didn't need Rhodes Island's help anyway,' or 'I'd rather die than work with them.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "But at least you don't seem to be that stubborn. Is there anything else you'd like to say? If not, I'd like to head back to Rhodes Island.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "I never knew Rhodes Island had an aircraft like that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Heh, we have a lot of things that might surprise you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Just like you, we don't want to play our entire hand.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "You're not counting us as one of your cards, are you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "Um, Madam Ch'en... there's an incoming transmission on a private line.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "It's for you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Hello?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "text": "Well done, Madam Ch'en.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "text": "Is Madam Swire also on this channel?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "text": "I am.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "text": "Please report your progress.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "text": "I bailed Rhodes Island out, and also finished arrangements for the various brigades. Coordinating and managing everything took me three full nights.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "text": "How about you, Madam Ch'en?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "I've already taken back—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "—with Rhodes Island's assistance, we've taken back the L.G.D. Headquarters. Their commander will spread word of their defeat through the ranks.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "The Reunion forces left in Lungmen have been coralled into our ambush points using the routes we arranged for them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Next, we just need to wait for their counterattack.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "My mission is now complete.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "text": "I've also received reports from a few of your other colleagues. All missions in the last phase have been completed flawlessly. Well done, all of you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "text": "We will now move onto the next phase.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
